OL,3,AMahmood signals rethink on migrants'
OL,4,Aright to remain
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood has
OL,7,Fsignalled she is willing to rethink
OL,8,Fplans to make it harder for foreign
OL,9,Fworkers to claim permanent residence in
OL,10,Fthe UK.
OL,12,FThe home secretary has been under
OL,13,Fpressure to water down the proposals
OL,14,Ffrom a significant number of Labour
OL,15,FMPs, including Housing Secretary Angela
OL,16,FRayner, and trade unions.
OL,18,FIn a speech to Labour's annual
OL,19,Fconference, Mahmood acknowledged "some
OL,20,Fhave said elements of these reforms are
OL,21,Fnot fair".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
